  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Main flow",
      "items": [
        "① Trackers page: link an account (OAuth), then exchange-token with the c2c JWT",
        "② Tokens exchanged; on link, the last ~30 activities are pulled (Garmin: replay request)",
        "③ Each new activity arrives as a webhook through HAProxy",
        "④ Excluded types and trackless activities are dropped; the 30 newest are kept per user",
        "⑤ A simplified track becomes a Mapbox PNG in SOS",
        "⑥ The outing editor lists activities, each with its matching c2c activity, and their geometry to prefill an outing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Per vendor",
      "items": [
        "Strava, Suunto, Decathlon, Coros: OAuth 2, pull on link, webhook per activity",
        "Garmin: OAuth 1.0a (request secret in Redis, 1 h); no pull, Garmin replays N days through the webhook",
        "Polar: webhook only, signed raw body; no backfill (AccessLink only serves 90 days after linking)",
        "Strava and Polar subscribe their webhook at startup; the subscription is shared in PostgreSQL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Preprod uses this tracking",
      "items": [
        "No tracking runs on preprod-app; its UI calls tracking.camptocamp.org",
        "Preprod tokens: JWT_SECRET_KEY_EXTRA, user ids shifted by 1,000,000,000",
        "Revocation asked to the preprod API (C2C_API_BASE_URL_EXTRA); no answer means 401",
        "FRONTEND_EXTRA_ORIGINS for CORS; OAuth return goes through the production relay"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Operations",
      "items": [
        "v7 fleet: one container on ui1, behind both HAProxies",
        "/health and /health/ready (database); Prometheus metrics on :8081",
        "Same JWT secret as v6_api, or every call is 401 (looks like CORS)",
        "A missed sync is recovered with the per-vendor backfill scripts"
      ]
    }
  ]
